            "source_code": "TAWC",
            "source_notes": "Available water capacity between -33 and -1500 kPa. Unit cm/m: the summary-file tables write cm m-1 (ISRIC Reports 2004/03 p.29, 2004/06 p.29, 2005/02 p.24, 2005/04 p.23), cm3 cm-3 10^2 (2007/02 p.24), cm3 cm-3 10^2 or vol% (2008/05 p.29, 2010/01 p.29, 2010/07b p.23) or vol. % (2004/01 p.29), all numerically equal to cm/m; Jordan and Southern Africa: see the dataset variant. Not corrected for coarse fragments: Reports 2003/04 p.6 and p.22, 2004/01 p.7, 2004/03 p.7, 2004/04 p.5, 2004/06 p.8, 2008/05 p.8, 2010/01 p.8, 2010/07b p.6; Reports 2005/02, 2005/04 and 2007/02 are silent."
