            "source_code": "CECc",
            "source_notes": "Clay CEC recalculated by ISRIC from CECS and organic carbon with an assumed contribution of 350 cmolc kg-1 OC (ten reports; Central Africa: see the dataset variant); Reports 2008/05, 2010/01 and 2010/07b write '350 cmolc per 100 g OC' in the property list (p.8, p.8, p.5) and '350 cmolc kg-1 OC' in the notes (p.27, p.27, p.21). 3,661 SOTERsummaryFile rows equal 140 and none is above, in seven datasets (Brazil 18, SOVEUR v2 1,932, Jordan 1, Kenya 54, Latin America and the Caribbean 1,239, Southern Africa 416, Indo-Gangetic Plains 1): a ceiling that no report documents; published as in the source."
